OL,3,GNEWSASix months on, are weekly food
OL,4,Awaste collections a success?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been six months since many
OL,7,Fhouseholds started getting weekly food
OL,8,Fwaste collections for the first time,
OL,9,Fwith other areas seeing their
OL,10,Fcollections increased from fortnightly
OL,11,Fto weekly.
OL,13,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council
OL,14,F(ERYC), which has moved to weekly
OL,15,Fcollections, said the project had been
OL,16,F"as successful as we expected it to
OL,17,Fbe", with 9,000 households requesting
OL,18,Fstarter packs - many of whom hadn't
OL,19,Frecycled food before.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
