OL,3,GNEWSASix months on, are weekly food
OL,4,Awaste collections a success?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities in Lincolnshire,
OL,7,Fmeanwhile, said the scheme had had a
OL,8,Fpositive start there, too.
OL,10,FThe service was introduced as part of
OL,11,Fthe government's Simpler Recycling
OL,12,Finitiative.
